					"script": "function onCenserInhaled(c) {\n\tc.st.target.addStatus(Status.CorrosiveSmoke);\n}\n\nfunction onCenserPurgedHit(c) {\n\tif (c.st.target.side == skill.unit.side) return;\n\tfor (i in 0...c.inhalation)\n\t\tskill.unit.castSkill(Skill.CorrosiveSpray_Skill, {unit : c.st.target}, skill);\n\tfor (a in getAllies(c.st.target))\n\t\tif (a.isMelee(c.st.target))\n\t\t\tfor (i in 0...c.inhalation)\n\t\t\t\tskill.unit.castSkill(Skill.CorrosiveSpray_Skill, {unit : a}, skill);\n}\n\nfunction onCenserEval(c) {\n\tvar n = c.inhalation;\n\tfor (t in c.st.getOtherTargets())\n\t\tif (t.target.isMelee(c.st.target))\n\t\t\tn++;\n\tc.st.attackCount = n;\n}",
