					"script": "function onSkillPlayed(a) {\n\tif (vars.p2) return;\n\tvar has = false;\n\tfor (t in a.getTargets()){\n\t\tif (t.target == skill.unit){\n\t\t\thas = true;\n\t\t\tbreak;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\tif (!has) return;\n\tcheckLife();\n}\n\nfunction onEndTurn(){\n\tif (!isCurrentTurn(skill.unit)) return;\n\tcheckLife();\n}\n\nfunction checkLife(){\n\tif (vars.p2) return;\n\tif (skill.unit.health > 1) return;\n\tfor (s in skill.unit.getAllStatus()) {\n\t\tif (s.kind != Status.Champion) {\n\t\t\tskill.unit.cancelStatus(s.kind);\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\tvars.p2 = true;\n\tnewPhaseHiltrerd(skill.unit);\n}\n\nfunction onEndRound(){\n\tif (!vars.p2) return;\n\tplay(\"Taunt\");\n\tfor (t in getPlayerUnits()){\n\t\tcastSkill(Skill.Shockwave, { unit : t }, skill);\n\n\t}\n}",
