					"script": "function onEval(t) {\n\tt.attackCount = 1 + skill.unit.getStatusCount(Status.Focus);\n}\n\nfunction onHit(a) {\n\tif (++vars.attackCount >= a.attackCount ) {\n\t\ta.target.pushback({ unit : skill.unit }, getPushback(a), a);\n\t\ta.target.consumeStatus(Status.Focus,floor(a.target.getStatusCount(Status.Focus)/2));\n\t}\n}\n\nfunction getPushback( a ) {\n\treturn vars.value1;\n}\n\nfunction onPostSkill() {\n\tvars.attackCount = 0;\n}",
