		{
			"name": "fiefEvent",
			"columns": [
				{
					"typeStr": "0",
					"name": "id",
					"opt": false,
					"scope": null
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "1",
					"name": "desc",
					"opt": true,
					"kind": "localizable"
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "8",
					"name": "conditions",
					"opt": false
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "4",
					"name": "weight",
					"opt": true,
					"documentation": "Probability that the event happens compared to other events.\n\nDefault is 1\n\nex :\n2 -> x 2 chances that the event happens\n\n0.5 -> chances / 2\n\n0 -> the event wont happen randomly"
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "3",
					"name": "cooldown",
					"opt": true,
					"documentation": "Cooldown (in rest count) for the event to be able to trigger again.\n\ncooldown = -1 => The event will never trigger after the first time (used for unique events)\n\nIf not defined, the default cooldown is defined in the constants by Fief_EventDefaultCooldown\n\n0 is advised for scripted events, or more generally event whose weight is == 0"
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "3",
					"name": "duration",
					"opt": true,
					"documentation": "Even duration in rests\n\nOn regular events, defines the duration of the effects / visual modifications.\n\nOn audiences:\n- The NPC will leave the queue after the duration.\n- If not set, the value of Fief_AudienceNpcStayRests will be used instead\n- If set to -1, the NPC will never leave (might be used on scripted audiences)"
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "17",
					"name": "consequences",
					"opt": true
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "8",
					"name": "params",
					"opt": true,
					"documentation": "List of parameters that can modify the event properties.\n\n/!\\ Only supports changing consequences props for now "
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "1",
					"name": "comment",
					"opt": true
				},
				{
					"typeStr": "2",
					"name": "done",
					"opt": null
				}
			],
