					"opt": true,
					"documentation": "Defines the parent goal.\nProps might be inherited from parents when not defined : desc, props.expireRests, props.reminderDialog\n\nWhen trying to create a goal that has children, the goal will instantiate as one of its valid children.\nWe can define the valid children by adding an allowCondition to the parent props.\n\nIf there are no valid children for a goal, it will fail to instantiate."
